  "events": [ {
    "tStartMs": 2000,
    "dDurationMs": 4060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- Can you just like ... Yo-Yo like a basic Yo-Yo\n- Yeah, like this"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 6060,
    "dDurationMs": 1340,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "- But this is not a basic Yo-Yo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 7600,
    "dDurationMs": 1800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "No"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 21800,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That is awesome"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 23260,
    "dDurationMs": 1300,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Nicely done!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 25100,
    "dDurationMs": 2960,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "This is Ben Conde, he's got \na brand new channel on YouTube"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 28060,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Which is about Yo-Yoing\nlike a crazy person"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 30880,
    "dDurationMs": 2920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "But, I'm going to figure out\nhow this is possible"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 33800,
    "dDurationMs": 3640,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How this is possible with a string\nthat's not connected to the Yo-Yo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 37560,
    "dDurationMs": 1860,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To get it to do all\nof these insane things"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 43990,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Wow"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46100,
    "dDurationMs": 740,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Gosh!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 46850,
    "dDurationMs": 2460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "How did you learn to do that?\nThat's crazy!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 49310,
    "dDurationMs": 920,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Uh"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 50230,
    "dDurationMs": 2320,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Just a lot of like lonely saturday nights"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 54120,
    "dDurationMs": 2800,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So watch this motion here, there, and then you tug up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 56920,
    "dDurationMs": 1900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Yeah you got it\n-(Derek Laughs) This is not gonna happen!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 58820,
    "dDurationMs": 840,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "You got it, dude!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 59840,
    "dDurationMs": 2020,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Pull up- ooooh, that was close!"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 62560,
    "dDurationMs": 1220,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Tug up! Aww..."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 64960,
    "dDurationMs": 3460,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "-Pull up! There you go! -(Derek cheers)"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 68420,
    "dDurationMs": 4559,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So, how does this work? When the yo-yo is\nreleased it unspools as it falls,"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 72979,
    "dDurationMs": 3691,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "gaining kinetic energy and rotational\nenergy from the gravitational potential"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 76670,
    "dDurationMs": 6089,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "energy it had to start with yo-yos can\nspin really fast, around six thousand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 82759,
    "dDurationMs": 1500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "revolutions per minute."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 84259,
    "dDurationMs": 3991,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's about as fast as most car engines\ncan turn over, and this is important"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 88250,
    "dDurationMs": 3929,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "because it gives the yo-yo gyroscopic\nstability which means its axis of"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 92179,
    "dDurationMs": 4261,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "rotation is maintained even if there's a\nbreeze or some little disturbances"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 96440,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "now since the yo-yo has a lot of angular\nmomentum it continues spinning in the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 99770,
    "dDurationMs": 2820,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "same direction but when Ben tugs the\nstring"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 102590,
    "dDurationMs": 3869,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "he pulls it from one side of the yo-yo\nover to the other so now as the yo-yo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 106459,
    "dDurationMs": 4480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "continues spinning it binds the string to\nthe spool and starts to roll up the string"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 110940,
    "dDurationMs": 3100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "If you look closely at this shot\nyou can actually see the exact moment"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 114049,
    "dDurationMs": 4021,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when the string binds to the spool\npreventing the yo-yo from unravelling"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 118070,
    "dDurationMs": 3000,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "further and falling off the string."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 124980,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "That's all there is to it, yeah,\nthere's no science behind it at all."
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 129180,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "To release the\nyo-yo Ben throws it out and upwards"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 131580,
    "dDurationMs": 4500,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "without pulling back so it completely\nunspools and continues spinning at the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 136080,
    "dDurationMs": 4100,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "same high rate of rotation, but how does\nhe catch it with just a string?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 140300,
    "dDurationMs": 7480,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So the way yo-yos actually do roll up is\nthere's friction pads inside the yo-yo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 147780,
    "dDurationMs": 4200,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "these ones are made out of silicone you\nsee this like little gap that inside"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 151980,
    "dDurationMs": 3750,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "when that string goes inside that\ncreates friction and while it's spinning"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 155730,
    "dDurationMs": 2400,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it rolls the yo-yo up"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 158130,
    "dDurationMs": 3060,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "So if Ben can lodge the string in the\ngap of the yo-yo"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 161190,
    "dDurationMs": 3390,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "it catches on the friction pads and the\nyo-yo starts to roll up the string again"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 165120,
    "dDurationMs": 3330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "Even without the friction pads when the\nstring wraps around the axle it"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 168450,
    "dDurationMs": 3570,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "creates a significant amount of friction\nin the same way that ropes wrapped"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 172020,
    "dDurationMs": 4770,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "around bollards hold big ships to their\ndocks, the amount of tension a coiled rope"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 176790,
    "dDurationMs": 5010,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "or string can hold is given by the belt\nfriction equation. This equation shows"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 181800,
    "dDurationMs": 3690,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "that the force the string can exert on\nthe yo-yo increases exponentially with"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 185490,
    "dDurationMs": 3900,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "the angle the string makes around the\naxle so even a few turns around the"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 189390,
    "dDurationMs": 2970,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "yo-yo allow been to pull it back into\nhis hand"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 192360,
    "dDurationMs": 2780,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "(Derek): What is your favorite yo-yo moment?"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 195560,
    "dDurationMs": 4240,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "My freestyle in 2011 the crowd stood up\nand it felt good"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 199810,
    "dDurationMs": 6330,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It brought tears to my eyes but I went back\nto my hotel room to cry 'cause I was happy"
    } ]
  }, {
    "tStartMs": 206140,
    "dDurationMs": 1880,
    "segs": [ {
      "utf8": "It was a good moment"
    } ]
